* This program's file size deliberately exceeds the tiny max_file_size
* configured in .natural-lsp.toml (64 bytes) so the indexer skips it as
* too_large, exercising the build-end skip-aggregate window/logMessage
* Warning (feature 26, Story 1). The content itself is valid Natural.
PROGRAM BIG
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #X (A10)
END-DEFINE
END
